[N 28-29 Back on Track]
[D Forever Shaman 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Shaman only, picked by hand: for a shaman who left the route after Blackfathom, reached 28 in the dungeons and never played chapters 13w-19. Call of Water, the Ironforge trainer and the Stormwind errands that still matter, then back to Astranaar for chapter 20.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffffffBack on track at 28|r  -  you stand in Darnassus (or anywhere with the hearthstone ready) at level 28 with Call of Water (94499) in the log and the Unfilled Red Waterskin still empty. This chapter takes from chapters 13w-19 only what gives gear or opens a dungeon or class quest: Call of Water and the Water Totem, the trainer, the Stormwind chain that ends in the Seal of Wrynn, and three dungeon pickups. Everything else in those chapters is left behind. Hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00What you need:|r the flight paths of Lakeshire, Thelsamar, Menethil Harbor, Auberdine and Astranaar, silver for the trainer (Mana Spring Totem alone is 40s) and 3 Silk Cloth for the Stormwind chain (Auction House if your bags are short). About two and a half hours, most of it birds, boats and running
[A Shaman] |cffffcc00Abandon first|r, in the quest log, whichever of these you still hold - they are XP-only leftovers of the chapters you skipped and gate nothing ahead: [QS19 Tharil'zun] [QS115 Shadow Magic] [QS91 Solomon's Law] [QS124 A Baying of Gnolls] [QS161 A Dark Threat Looms] [QS471 Apprentice's Duties] [QS1017 Mage Summoner] [QS343 Speaking of Fortitude]. Keep Call of Water, Tinkmaster Overspark and The Tower of Althalaxx. Then tick this step by hand

[OC][A Shaman] |cffffffffRedridge: Stonewatch Falls|r  -  the falls are in the east, 10 units south of the Tower of Ilgalar. Stonewatch Keep (x 60-66, y 52-60) is all elites: stay on the road north of it. The Shadowhide gnolls on the east road are 22-26 and Morganth's tower (75.0,49.5) is thick with them: the statue lies east of it, walk south from there
