[A Shaman] Hand the bracers in at the Forgotten Shrine, [QT94502] [QA94503 Call of Water] (the log text still says return to Norric; ignore it) - the pond glows and the Minor Manifestation of Water appears in it [G45.6,59.9 Westfall]
