[A Shaman] Back at [TAR1572 Thorgrum Borrelson], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Ironforge]|r [G33.9,51 Loch Modan]
[A Shaman] In the Forlorn Cavern at [TAR258098 Eldrun Stormbreaker], [T] train |cff66ff66Mana Spring Totem|r (level 26, 40s) first, then whatever you still owe from the level 24 and 26 rows (sheet: Rockbiter 4, Earth Shock 4, Lightning Shield 3 are musts, Strength of Earth 2 and Healing Wave 5 buys - 35s each; Magma Totem 40s; Lightning Bolt 5 (40s) when gold is easy; 2g 55s for the lot). Nothing on the sheet is bought at 28 [G47.1,13.8 Ironforge]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Water totems from the lower rows|r, when gold is easy: Poison Cleansing Totem (level 22, 30s) and Frost Resistance Totem (level 24, 35s). Healing Stream Totem rank 1 is not on Eldrun's list in the data - look for it now that you hold the totem
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Head slot still empty?|r If a Pattern: Stormrider's Leather Helm from Blackfathom sits in your bags, it reads at Leatherworking 125 and makes a bind-on-pickup leather helm (+13 Sta +10 Spi, req 25; 25.0 on the weights, level with Defender's). Materials on the 14 Nov tooltip: 12 Medium Leather, 2 Cured Medium Hide, 3 Cerulean Dye ("crafted by alchemists": Auction House). Fimble Finespindle in the Great Forge (40.2,33.7) teaches the Journeyman recipes on the way to 125 (Dark Leather Belt at 100, Hillman's Shoulders at 105 on his Wowhead Forever list, 12 Nov). Do it now only if the leather is at hand; the pattern keeps
