[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00The Attack!|r  -  Lord Gregor Lescovar (31) and Marzon the Silent Blade (30) talk in the garden beside Tyrion, then it is a fight: stand in the garden until the talk is over (the quest says so), then kill both. They are not elite in the DB but level 30-31 and come together: alone at 29 this is the one hard fight of the chapter - full health and mana, totems down before the talk ends, or ask a passer-by for a hand. This is a kill quest, not an escort
